# {{lb|en|transitive|figuratively}} To [[produce]], [[give rise]] to.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2006|author=R. Bruce Hull|title=Infinite Nature|publisher=University of Chicago Press|isbn=9780226359441|url=http://books.google.com/books?id=1gOZ1K3CyQAC&pg=PA156&dq=birthed|page=156|passage=Biological evolution created a human mind that enabled cultural evolution, which now outpaces and outclasses the force that '''birthed''' it.}}

